{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1562642,\"title\":\"Ghost Soldier\",\"tagline\":\"Heaven sent. Hell to pay.\",\"overview\":\"Henry “Fitz” Fitzgerald has spent years living quietly off the grid, hiding from a past few people know anything about. But when a powerful foreign corporation moves into his hometown to seize his neighbors’ land for a massive payday, Fitz is forced to reveal who he really is: a former Special Forces soldier and advanced weapons developer. Armed with experimental technology, lethal combat skills, and an unwavering code of justice, Fitz wages a one-man war against an enemy that never saw him coming.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8Y4oJ5iUs3hgPcDB3SIEmsNYjZk.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ggqvhSdAASrseKuMlzk51sbvbE8.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":35,\"year\":2026,\"runtime\":90,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":18000000,\"revenue\":8308612,\"director\":\"William Eubank\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":125324,\"name\":\"William Eubank\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/u2px8MjeVsqk4WMqH6MSzSMqrZa.jpg\"},{\"id\":8767,\"name\":\"Jim Caviezel\",\"character\":\"Fitz\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3dwavYsGYA6zzzipfdLIHbudIZW.jpg\"},{\"id\":2786277,\"name\":\"Cameron Gayden\",\"character\":\"Jack Hernandez\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/isDyNqUb8e2EflIxvQ1z7ebwfev.jpg\"},{\"id\":52442,\"name\":\"Olivia Thirlby\",\"character\":\"Heidi\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x9ZlUX617wi9li2TJ5UuYpHzPfN.jpg\"},{\"id\":74242,\"name\":\"Shea Whigham\",\"character\":\"Scott Peary\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/d3caK3l4UfbnzOxv95wLoFLZzMO.jpg\"},{\"id\":1078613,\"name\":\"Beau Knapp\",\"character\":\"Mirko\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6OWe75RIFETlY3iqvTjswcXRc33.jpg\"},{\"id\":