ce for survival, and Roberto and his companions find themselves caught between hordes of infected and divided loyalties.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1294189,\"title\":\"The Mongoose\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eSS5mvSG84UUuvtbHel5Yu3Wik4.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bySCyjQXNPgsnLTlgJpSMnRazPD.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A falsely accused war hero with nothing to lose leads police on an epic televised cross-country car chase, helped by members of his former Special Forces Army battalion and closely monitored by a fascinated public rooting for his safe getaway.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1288445,\"title\":\"Mutiny\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pu2VxGlpGwffOx292w18b1tv96j.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qDa0fqDqIBCovRp975RvtGPcuN3.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After witnessing his billionaire boss' murder and being framed for the crime, Cole Reed boards a cargo ship on a one-man crusade to avenge his boss' death only to discover an international conspiracy.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1384216,\"title\":\"The Dog Stars\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5O616X9vmRzQdB68PHzBewPittd.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3k7GzxOdLZkN3eZsuhLi2eRzkXO.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After the world's population has been ravaged by a pandemic, a man lives a lonesome existence in a Colorado airplane hangar with his dog and a dour gunman he has befriended. When a mysterious transmission comes through on the radio while he’s flying his old Cessna, it sparks a hunt for the provenance of the sound.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":70160,\"title\":\"The Hunger Games\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/apa5G43Hha7kH7wJG0gkkHT7FA9.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eVYChqJavS1DCXFeJE2lzVUMLKp.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In a dystopian society where the Capitol forces each district to send two young tributes to fight to the death in a televised spectacle, a girl volunteers to take her sister’s place, setting the stage for a struggle of survival and defiance.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":155,\"title\":\"The Dark Knight\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qJ2tW6WMUDux911r6m7haRef0WH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cfT29Im5VDvjE0RpyKOSdCKZal7.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Batman raises the stakes in his war on crime. With the help of Lt. Jim Gordon and District Attorney Harvey Dent, Batman sets out to dismantle the remaining criminal organizations that plague the streets. The partnership proves to be effective, but they soon find themselves prey to a reign of chaos unleashed by a rising criminal mastermind known to the terrified citizens of Gotham as the Joker.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1419406,\"title\":\"The Shadow's Edge\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cHKo3m8N1fwvEy2ZEr0xGmmMODV.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4BtL2vvEufDXDP4u6xQjjQ1Y2aT.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Macau Police brings the tracking expert police officer out of retirement to help catch a dangerous group of professional thieves.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1377237,\"title\":\"Runner\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vJk2TW1QZAmBiD7oj9ZF9EPTYY1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/npXZNWjOEYrqdMDPQ11SGBrXqAG.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A former soldier is thrown into a brutal race against time when a critical medical delivery makes him and his unlikely partner the targets of a ruthless cartel. As the mission spirals into a deadly manhunt, every detour, delay, and bullet pushes them closer to failure. With betrayal closing in from every side, they must survive the chase and deliver their cargo to save the life of a little girl.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1657630,\"title\":\"The Awakening\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AhP971WogMHbF5iKJPKi6e6oaya.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4pYKqctQvvdyhuGjiK4szH9jEv9.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An elite military unit on a mission in the South American jungle encounters a deadly supernatural force revealing an ancient presence that continues to claim anyone who dares enter its domain.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Action\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1284046,\"title\":\"Onslaught\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eAs7G3yFaULpfwfVdGvPo5HmFJS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pmPXXniQlb4EdYY0gVZO90rf54F.jpg\",\"rating\":5.6,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a rogue squad of genetically engineered super soldiers break loose in the desert, a badass Army sniper must unleash hell to protect her young daughter.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1561726,\"title\":\"Masterplan\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5xmXVd7nCK3tAo34XkO58SxUCip.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fAlQZsCOCvxOj0PmFmt4i8IWR2u.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a legendary thief sets his sights on the Mona Lisa, he recruits two young strangers to help him before revealing they are long-lost siblings… and oh yes, by the way, he is their father. Thrown into a chaotic reunion they never asked for, this new family must learn to work together — and try not to kill each other — if they want any chance at pulling off the heist of the century.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1290821,\"title\":\"Shelter\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cv7DeQQ7TOozPoTCBdNJIvWKhU1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nHxWyy18SvAZ8jJeemtS8k1UNjM.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A man living in self-imposed exile on a remote island rescues a young girl from a violent storm, setting off a chain of events that forces him out of seclusion to protect her from enemies tied to his past.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"UKaWzMf9Ybc\",\"name\":\"New Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"l0pTZqZWs-c\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}